  "description": "QEBNIX crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H102 N10 O24 Yb4 2+,2(F6 P1 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.430-3.791 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.26-111.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(L)4(NO3)2(H2O)2](PF6)2·4CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
